<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Sugar buys 30,000 tonnes U.S. soy/corn - Sept 5.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Sugar buys 30,000 tonnes U.S. soy/corn - Sept 5.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Taiwan Sugar Corp bought 20,000 tonnes of No.2 or better U.S. yellow corn and 10,000 tonnes of No.2 or better U.S. yellow soybeans from Cargill at a tender on Thursday, traders said.</p>
</text>
